atory factor-1 in monocyte CD95\nexpression and CD95-mediated apoptosis. Cell Death Differ 10(5):615–617.\nE3512\n|\nwww.pnas.org/cgi/doi/10.1073/pnas.1208972109\nZak et al.\nDownloaded from https://www.pnas.org by YALE UNIVERSITY on June 26, 2026 from IP address 128.36.7.84.\n\n\n===\n\n', 'role': 'user'}], 'thinking': None, 'web_search_options': None, 'safety_identifier': None, 'store': None, 'prompt_cache_key': None, 'custom_llm_provider': 'openai', 'drop_params': None, 'model': 'gpt-5.4', 'n': None, 'include_server_side_tool_invocations': None, 'service_tier': None}
